  "name": "Level-21 Spider Bomb and Firepot Drone deal damage in The Deadmines (#9792)",
  "contract": [
    "#9792 reports that Build: Spider Bomb 500535 and Build: Firepot Drone 500600 deal 0 damage for a level-21",
    "Tinker in The Deadmines (map 36, Mr. Smite's cove). Both builds summon a device (226012 / 226112) whose",
    "npc_ascension_tinker_device AI casts Spider Bomb Explosion 801982 or Firepot 500601 on enemies once it is",
    "within 2 yd of its focus. Expected minimum from Spell.dbc at device level 21 (the device takes its",
    "owner's level): 801982 is 28 base + 1 die + 4.5 per level above SpellLevel 11 = 28 + 1 + 45 = 74 Fire;",
    "500601 is 181 + 1 = 182 scaled by the Tinker level curve .0267291844 + .0048541098 L + .0001859598 L^2",
    "= 0.2107 at L 21, about 38 Fire. Owner Ranged Attack Power and spell power coefficients only add.",
    "The golem fixture stands at the viewer's level 21 so the Deadmines per-viewer view never shrinks the",
    "damage the shared pool takes (a band below 21 would only enlarge it). Linear monster resistance at",
    "level 21 averages 21 / 5 = 4.2 %, whose discrete partial resist removes at most 20 %: one landed",
    "explosion takes at least 59 health and one landed Firepot at least 30. Equal-level NPC casts keep their",
    "4 % magic / 5 % ranged miss, so four detonations per device must together reach that floor; four",
    "misses in a row have a probability below 7e-6. The players and fixtures are phased away from the",
    "dungeon's own creatures. Refill 150 Mana (both builds cost a percentage of base mana), reset the",
    "build cooldown and restore Firepot's three charges between trials without touching hit chance or",
    "damage."
  ],
